  evidence:
  - evidence_type: LLM_SUGGESTION
    source: https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium1113.pdf
    notes: DSMZ1113 adds 100 mL named Leptospira Enrichment EMJH to separately prepared
      Difco medium base. This is the enrichment supplement, not the base or complete
      culture medium. The Difco/BBL manufacturer manual describes the named enrichment
      as albumin, polysorbate80 and unspecified additional growth factors, consistent
      with the source preparation. Only albumin and polysorbate80 are transcribed,
      with PARTIAL completeness because growth factors are explicitly unspecified.
      No albumin species, component quantities, solvent, catalogue/version equivalence
      or whole-medium identity is invented.
